xed by @aashish254 in https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/pull/1416\n* fix(integrations): the LangChain wrappers read nested answers through the shared guard by @aashish254 in https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/pull/1417\n* fix(laya-ts): a non-object answer is omitted from the projection, as the oracle omits it by @aashish254 in https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/pull/1418\n* feat(cpp): ONNX Runtime backend (laya_onnx) and the onnx lane by @keemsisi in https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/pull/1420\n* fix(structured): reject a non-array anyOf/oneOf as a schema error by @aashish254 in https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/pull/1364\n* fix(confidence): a JSON integer wider than a double is refused, not crashed, by every confidence reader by @aashish254 in https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/pull/1413\n* docs(adoption): cover adversarial decision context by @aditya00801 in https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/pull/1419\n\n## New Contributors\n* @aditya00801 made their first contribution in https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/pull/1419\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya/compare/v0.4.17...v0.4.18","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NandhaKishorM/laya/releases/428916274/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":5}